label dialogue_1
join celestial_intervener center
celestial_intervener: Oop got you out of there just in time huh? Yeah that was what we call a [color=red][TIMELINE ALTERING EVENT][/color], and we tend to look a little down on that, so I decided to help you out!
celestial_intervener: Anywho, your [color=blue]Madra[/color] is running a little dry. We're safe here, so sit and cycle: it fills your Madra and trains your Spirit. Come back when you're all plumped up!
leave celestial_intervener
[end_timeline]
label dialogue_2
join celestial_intervener center
celestial_intervener: There you go! Now you've got plenty of Madra to defend yourself!
celestial_intervener: These woods should be pretty safe even for someone like you! Why don't you go find a [DREADBEAST] or [REMNANT] to kick their ass?
leave celestial_intervener
[end_timeline]
label dialogue_3
join celestial_intervener center
celestial_intervener: You made it back! Took a few hits out there, huh? Here at home, your wounds won't close on their own.
celestial_intervener: Head down to the river and train your body. Every rep patches you up and builds your Strength. Come find me once you're a little stronger.
celestial_intervener: Oh, and that win earned you a path point. Spend it on your Path!
leave celestial_intervener
[end_timeline]
label dialogue_4
join celestial_intervener center
celestial_intervener: Two stars already! Your core's coming along nicely.
celestial_intervener: I have to go soon, so listen. Fill all ten stars, and train Strength and Spirit as far as this stage allows. Then the heavens will test you: the Tribulation.
celestial_intervener: Here, take this map. There's a little refugee camp tucked away in the woods — go find them. Got a merchant with them who'll trade you real gear for coin. Tell 'em I sent you!
leave celestial_intervener
[end_timeline]
label dialogue_5
join celestial_intervener center
celestial_intervener: Look at those arms! That's how you grow here: cycling trains your Spirit, and the river trains your Strength.
celestial_intervener: Your core's another story: it only deepens in a fight. Every enemy you beat fills it a little, and every star you fill earns a path point.
celestial_intervener: Take this manual too. It teaches Horse Stance, another drill for the river. Now go fill two stars of your core!
leave celestial_intervener
[end_timeline]